{"3373080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toybox Aces", "steam_appid": 3373080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to do in Toybox Aces?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready your airplane, get into the air, and take down your enemies. Returning safely is optional—as long as you complete your mission goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except... the airplane is a tiny toy plane, the arena is a kid’s room, and things aren’t quite what they seem for those with limited imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense air-to-air dogfights on an unprecedented scale. Use the environment to take cover, sneak up on opponents, and wreak havoc amidst ground targets—all while keeping your airplane under control, a challenge even without enemy fire.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373080/extras/39bbb91e47e6bfc744a7ca711ae81f68.avif?t=1778439847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373080/extras_big/39bbb91e47e6bfc744a7ca711ae81f68.avif?t=1778439847 width=800 height=304 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you’ll encounter</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dogfights</strong>: This is what you’re here for, right? Close-range air combat against other players, AI, or both.<br></li><li><strong>Air-to-Ground Combat</strong>: Destroy ground targets—but don’t be fooled, they usually bite back.<br></li><li><strong>Missions</strong>: There are jobs to do, and you’re the one to do them.<br></li><li><strong>Races</strong>: Yes, races—against other players, AI, or yourself, but always against the merciless stopwatch.<br></li><li><strong>Time Trial</strong>: More like target practice, where you can shine with your flight, shooting, and planning skills. Destroy targets against the clock and outpace your competition.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to do in Toybox Aces?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready your airplane, get into the air, and take down your enemies. Returning safely is optional—as long as you complete your mission goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except... the airplane is a tiny toy plane, the arena is a kid’s room, and things aren’t quite what they seem for those with limited imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense air-to-air dogfights on an unprecedented scale. Use the environment to take cover, sneak up on opponents, and wreak havoc amidst ground targets—all while keeping your airplane under control, a challenge even without enemy fire.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373080/extras/39bbb91e47e6bfc744a7ca711ae81f68.avif?t=1778439847\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373080/extras_big/39bbb91e47e6bfc744a7ca711ae81f68.avif?t=1778439847 width=800 height=304 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you’ll encounter</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dogfights</strong>: This is what you’re here for, right? Close-range air combat against other players, AI, or both.<br></li><li><strong>Air-to-Ground Combat</strong>: Destroy ground targets—but don’t be fooled, they usually bite back.<br></li><li><strong>Missions</strong>: There are jobs to do, and you’re the one to do them.<br></li><li><strong>Races</strong>: Yes, races—against other players, AI, or yourself, but always against the merciless stopwatch.<br></li><li><strong>Time Trial</strong>: More like target practice, where you can shine with your flight, shooting, and planning skills. Destroy targets against the clock and outpace your competition.</li></ul>", "short_description": "A fast paced, action loaded, physics based, close air combat game with a twist: Instead of soaring through the skies, you fly a tiny toy plane, wreaking havoc in the kids room and beyond.", "supported_